---
permalink: /next/work/
title: Work
section: work
bodyClass: work-page
description: "Facades, domes, stages and city squares: the work of SMASH, an experience design studio in Stockholm."
styles:
  - work.css
---
{#- All the work, the quiet overview: each project's cover, a still, two to
    a row at one proportion, its name under it at body size. The home page
    walks through the same work room by room; this page shows it at a glance.
    Media markup is inline: {% image %} renders nothing in includes. -#}
<h1 class="visually-hidden">Work</h1>
<ol class="index grid page-start">
  {%- for w in work %}{% set h = stories[w.slug].cover %}
  <li>
    <a class="card" href="{{ w.url }}">
      <div class="media"{% if h.focus %} style="--focus: {{ h.focus }}"{% endif %}>
        {% image h.still, h.alt, "(max-width: 719px) 100vw, 47vw", ("eager" if loop.index <= 2 else "lazy") %}
      </div>
      <h2 class="caption t-body">{{ w.title }}</h2>
    </a>
  </li>
  {%- endfor %}
</ol>
